{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/c9e8a3633e05d130604edc950e76db5c.webp?t=1768559847\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/c9e8a3633e05d130604edc950e76db5c.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=129 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/34b0182e93ce2070d8d697e49f3b796e.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/34b0182e93ce2070d8d697e49f3b796e.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/34b0182e93ce2070d8d697e49f3b796e.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sudden death of the Master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her final words: <i><strong>\u201cKill the La.\u201d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/3ecb1dfbb04833c8acfd3396bb7d31bd.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/3ecb1dfbb04833c8acfd3396bb7d31bd.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/3ecb1dfbb04833c8acfd3396bb7d31bd.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once branded a child of misfortune and shunned by the world, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valhalla was saved by a single person: the Master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/c1770421beaa7fe17eb5c6369d69a137.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/c1770421beaa7fe17eb5c6369d69a137.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/c1770421beaa7fe17eb5c6369d69a137.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than a teacher\u2014almost family\u2014the Master was taken from her by murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the Master\u2019s last wish, Valhalla resolves to find \u2018La\u2019 and exact revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/32f8f5b8ac8692193b997811ddc5d181.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/32f8f5b8ac8692193b997811ddc5d181.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/52c83c76fe7ee49764e7d7f2986dac7d.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/52c83c76fe7ee49764e7d7f2986dac7d.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/52c83c76fe7ee49764e7d7f2986dac7d.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the only clue left behind, Valhalla arrives at a mysterious island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/240276026bc74f29aad630b2ea641601.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=1142 height=642 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/240276026bc74f29aad630b2ea641601.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/240276026bc74f29aad630b2ea641601.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it that a <strong>\u201cWish-Granting Tea Party\u201d</strong> is held here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this island, she must uncover the dark truth behind the Master\u2019s death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/9b2097ad3ef02bc0305d0222e2b74747.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/9b2097ad3ef02bc0305d0222e2b74747.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/9260fa8a7a20f3e5ec1ecec1b330abd6.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/9260fa8a7a20f3e5ec1ecec1b330abd6.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/9260fa8a7a20f3e5ec1ecec1b330abd6.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valhalla awakens in a strange place woven from childhood memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/0451eaa21d0e6c56d8576576af0b3063.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/0451eaa21d0e6c56d8576576af0b3063.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/0451eaa21d0e6c56d8576576af0b3063.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, the young Valhalla completed a <strong>puppet show</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/40e6ae96d981a18d6a0d93feb6dc223a.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/40e6ae96d981a18d6a0d93feb6dc223a.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/40e6ae96d981a18d6a0d93feb6dc223a.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon reaching the island, you gain a special ability called [Resonance], </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >which lets you dive into suspects\u2019 memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Resonance to peer into their pasts and unearth hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the clues you collect within dreams to identify the true \u2018La\u2019 who killed the Master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/d2fc56f1369eccffd335e76976c0e56e.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/d2fc56f1369eccffd335e76976c0e56e.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/1069debc6f796294b10d4d4bed68b060.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/1069debc6f796294b10d4d4bed68b060.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/1069debc6f796294b10d4d4bed68b060.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are nine \u2018La\u2019 on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Converse with them, build rapport, and earn their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/a8a99344e7f28e0a437f7e5efe068942.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/a8a99344e7f28e0a437f7e5efe068942.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/a8a99344e7f28e0a437f7e5efe068942.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But trust no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Your goal is singular\u2014revenge.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the true \u2018La\u2019, and shape the ending with your choices.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2524200?t=1768559847","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/4fdd14aafbc180fc75acd98065168e6afebb34e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768559847","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/88268512f3c6108cc89632af8755df7a9372bd0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768559847","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/88268512f3c6108cc89632af8755df7a9372bd0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768559847","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Suicide, Blood and Cruel Description"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/c9e8a3633e05d130604edc950e76db5c.webp?t=1768559847\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/c9e8a3633e05d130604edc950e76db5c.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" class=\"b