<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/240276026bc74f29aad630b2ea641601.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=1142 height=642 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/240276026bc74f29aad630b2ea641601.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/240276026bc74f29aad630b2ea641601.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it that a <strong>\u201cWish-Granting Tea Party\u201d</strong> is held here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this island, she must uncover the dark truth behind the Master\u2019s death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/9b2097ad3ef02bc0305d0222e2b74747.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/9b2097ad3ef02bc0305d0222e2b74747.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/9260fa8a7a20f3e5ec1ecec1b330abd6.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/9260fa8a7a20f3e5ec1ecec1b330abd6.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/9260fa8a7a20f3e5ec1ecec1b330abd6.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valhalla awakens in a strange place woven from childhood memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/0451eaa21d0e6c56d8576576af0b3063.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/0451eaa21d0e6c56d8576576af0b3063.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/0451eaa21d0e6c56d8576576af0b3063.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, the young Valhalla completed a <strong>puppet show</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/40e6ae96d981a18d6a0d93feb6dc223a.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/40e6ae96d981a18d6a0d93feb6dc223a.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/40e6ae96d981a18d6a0d93feb6dc223a.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon reaching the island, you gain a special ability called [Resonance], </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >which lets you dive into suspects\u2019 memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Resonance to peer into their pasts and unearth hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the clues you collect within dreams to identify the true \u2018La\u2019 who killed the Master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/d2fc56f1369eccffd335e76976c0e56e.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/d2fc56f1369eccffd335e76976c0e56e.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/1069debc6f796294b10d4d4bed68b060.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/1069debc6f796294b10d4d4bed68b060.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/1069debc6f796294b10d4d4bed68b060.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are nine \u2018La\u2019 on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Converse with them, build rapport, and earn their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/a8a99344e7f28e0a437f7e5efe068942.poster.avif?t=1768559847\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/a8a99344e7f28e0a437f7e5efe068942.webm?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/a8a99344e7f28e0a437f7e5efe068942.mp4?t=1768559847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But trust no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Your goal is singular\u2014revenge.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the true \u2018La\u2019, and shape the ending with your choices.</p>","developers":["Black Tangerine"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/ae7dcc3257378beaa7a5cbd61b35c56c7038f78c/header.jpg?t=1768559847","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2524200/790150/f8ea6777bd516adaec57956ed8aaa855a97cb2f6/1750927536/dash_av1.mpd?t=1738333250","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2524200/790150/f8ea6777bd516adaec57956ed8aaa855a97cb2f6/1750927536/dash_h264.mpd?t=1738333250","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2524200/790150/f8ea6777bd516adaec57956ed8aaa855a97cb2f6/1750927536/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1738333250","id":257076078,"name":"new_pv_teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257076078/59fe305c6b417b683b0eca71732c436d96cfd3bd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738333250"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2524200/1286858061/db8cf3aeb3e39c87d22c132e4ae5e1df3af963d3/1750927541/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750255585","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2524200/1286858061/db8cf3aeb3e39c87d22c132e4ae5e1df3af963d3/1750927541/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750255585","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2524200/1286858061/db8cf3aeb3e39c87d22c132e4ae5e1df3af963d3/1750927541/hls_264_maste